===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|köcher}}, itself with analogical umlaut from older {{m|gmh|kochære}}, from {{inh|de|goh|kohhāri}}, itself by adaptation to the suffix {{m|goh|-āri}} from older {{m|goh|kohhar}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*kokar}}, said to be from {{der|de|xhc|*kukur}}, perhaps ultimately from {{der|de|xgn-pro|*kökexür}}.

